From 57b698c4dd430737e4612dab65ae329446a9bc5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Romanov <romanovda@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 02:59:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Bake accepted parameter tries X4 and X5: photon depth limit
 225 mm past the ZDC face

Phase 4, X4_photon_depth and X5_photon_depth_face were parameter tries on X3's build (commit 50018ef8),
both ACCEPTED (461): X5 = 4.373 % mean / 8.030 % at 275 GeV per thrown Lambda -> n pi0 (X4 3.278 / 6.055;
pooled gained 972, lost 28, z +29.85; fair play PASS). gammaZMaxOffset is added to
HcalFarForwardZDC_SiPMonTile_r_pos, the ZDC centre (front face 3580.0 cm + length 183.27 cm / 2), so
-691.4 mm puts the photon depth limit 225 mm past the front face. Build X5b without parameters
reproduces X5 on D4 175 GeV (305 ZDC leaves identical). No behaviour change against X5.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/algorithms/reco/FarForwardNeutralsReconstructionConfig.h | 3 ++-
 src/global/reco/reco.cc                                      | 4 +++-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/algorithms/reco/FarForwardNeutralsReconstructionConfig.h b/src/algorithms/reco/FarForwardNeutralsReconstructionConfig.h
index c3abef3e..cd117291 100644
--- a/src/algorithms/reco/FarForwardNeutralsReconstructionConfig.h
+++ b/src/algorithms/reco/FarForwardNeutralsReconstructionConfig.h
@@ -33,7 +33,8 @@ struct FarForwardNeutralsReconstructionConfig {
   /** rotation from global to local coordinates */
   double globalToProtonRotation = -0.025;
   /** Neutron-photon separation in HcalFarForwardZDC */
-  double gammaZMaxOffset = 400;
+  // offset added to offsetPositionName (the ZDC centre); -691.4 mm puts the limit 225 mm past the front face
+  double gammaZMaxOffset = -691.4;
   double gammaMaxLength  = 150;
   double gammaMaxWidth   = 12;
   /** Photon pairing in HcalFarForwardZDC by the Lambda -> n pi0 -> n gamma gamma hypothesis: among the clusters
diff --git a/src/global/reco/reco.cc b/src/global/reco/reco.cc
index a7e81fda..eff01887 100644
--- a/src/global/reco/reco.cc
+++ b/src/global/reco/reco.cc
@@ -258,7 +258,9 @@ void InitPlugin(JApplication* app) {
        .clusterEminEcalEndcapP           = 1.0,
        .clusterEminLFHCAL                = 7.0,
        .globalToProtonRotation           = -0.025,
-       .gammaZMaxOffset                  = 400,
+       // photon candidates start within 225 mm of the ZDC front face: the offset is added to
+       // HcalFarForwardZDC_SiPMonTile_r_pos, the ZDC centre (front face + half the 1832.7 mm length)
+       .gammaZMaxOffset                  = -691.4,
        .gammaMaxLength                   = 150,
        .gammaMaxWidth                    = 12},
       app));
